From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:33:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: sun50i-dmic: Add the Allwinner A733

The DMIC controller of the A733 has the register layout of the H6 one.
Add a compatible with the H6 as fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the DMIC node with this
compatible binds sun50i-dmic and a capture returns the full 960000
bytes. The microphone pins are not wired on this board, so only block,
clock and DMA are exercised.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml      | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml
index 763b876047c1..2dd107be7242 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun20i-d1-dmic
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-dmic
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic
       - const: allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic
 
